{"id":"u-71f05690-57c6-434c-9227-705708970bc1","src":"community","title":"Kettlebuilding Calisthenics Hybrid 6/18/26","author":"Roam Rez","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/vGF92R-kettlebuilding-calisthenics-hybrid-final-2","desc":"This custom hybrid program integrates kettlebells, calisthenics, and foundational barbell lifts to transform the body into a lean, high-performance machine. The program is built on four core pillars:\n\nStructural Armor: Utilizing ATG Split Squats and Nordic Curls to bulletproof the patellar tendons and hamstrings, ensuring the joints can handle the high-impact forces of max-effort vertical jumps and explosive movements.\n\nExplosive Functionality: Leveraging heavy Kettlebell Snatches and Swings to develop the \"hip snap\" and rotational core power required to move, carry, and stabilize with real-world athleticism.\n\nCompound Strength & Control: Maintaining a high strength baseline with foundational lifts while using calisthenics to master bodyweight control, ensuring you move better and feel stronger in everyday life.\n\nActive Length & Mobility: Using the Couch Stretch and structural movements to \"un-glue\" the hips and core, removing the physical \"brakes\" that hold back veteran athletes from performing at a higher level.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Women's","Bodyweight Fitness","Olympic Weightlifting"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":1,"rate":5,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-07-15T14:51:20.067Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Hybrid Circuit","Skill & KB Power","The Heavy Armor Routine","Hypertrophy"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Ring Push-Ups (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"Form: Aim for a controlled stretch at the bottom; do not bounce off the chest.\n\nGoal: Upper chest development to balance out the shoulder work in Day 2."},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"Standard: Full extension at the bottom, chin clearly